nvoice CSV export\n\n**Copilot CLI**\n\nPR 212 looks right apart from one thing: the export formats amounts with the locale's decimal comma, so a CSV from a German account will not import back. I left a suggestion on line 48 of export.ts.\n\n_cmd+t opens the transcript here_","metadata":[{"label":"Agent","value":"Copilot CLI 1.0.30"},{"label":"Model","value":"claude-sonnet-4.5"},{"label":"State","tags":[{"text":"your turn","color":"amber"}]},{"label":"Folder","value":"/Users/dev/code/ledger"},{"label":"Started","value":"14:05"},{"label":"Last activity","value":"14:27 (5 min ago)"},{"label":"Turns","value":"1, the last took 1305 s"},{"label":"Process","value":"pid 48011 on ttys004"},{"label":"Session","value":"5d6e7f80-2a1b-4c3d-9e8f-0a1b2c3d4e05"},{"label":"Transcript","value":"~/.copilot/session-state/5d6e7f80-2a1b-4c3d-9e8f-0a1b2c3d4e05/events.jsonl"}]},"claude:8b2e4d71-1a3c-4f5e-8d9b-0c1d2e3f4a02":{"markdown":"## Offline sync for the notes view\n\n**You** · 14:29\n\n> Good, build it: queue edits in IndexedDB and replay them on reconnect\n\n**Claude Code**\n\nThe queue and the replay are in, with a test for a stale version. Running the sync tests.\n\n**Running** `Bash` since 14:31\n\n```\nbun test src/sync\n```\n\n_cmd+t opens the transcript here_","metadata":[{"label":"Agent","value":"Claude Code 2.1.278"},{"label":"Model","value":"claude-opus-5"},{"label":"State","tags":[{"text":"working","color":"blue"}]},{"label":"Folder","value":"/Users/dev/code/orbit"},{"label":"Branch","value":"feat/offline-sync"},{"label":"Started","value":"13:41"},{"label":"Last activity","value":"14:31 (8 s ago)"},{"label":"Turns","value":"1, the last took 208 s"},{"label":"Tokens","value":"141k context, 400 out"},{"label":"Permissions","value":"acceptEdits"},{"label":"Process","value":"pid 48220 on ttys007"},{"label":"Session","value":"8b2e4d71-1a3c-4f5e-8d9b-0c1d2e3f4a02"},{"label":"Transcript","value":"~/.claude/projects/-Users-dev-code-orbit/8b2e4d71-1a3c-4f5e-8d9b-0c1d2e3f4a02.jsonl"}]},"codex:019a4f2e-6c3b-7d10-9e8f-7a6b5c4d3e21":{"markdown":"## Why do the CSV totals drift by a cent on large invoices?\n\n**You** · 14:20\n\n> Why do the CSV totals drift by a cent on large invoices?\n\n**Codex**\n\nThe line totals are rounded before they are summed, so 40 lines can be a cent off. Summing in cents first and rounding once fixes it.\n\n**Running** `shell` since 14:31\n\n```\ncargo test totals\n```\n\n_cmd+t opens the transcript here_","metadata":[{"label":"Agent","value":"Codex 0.153.4"},{"label":"Model","value":"gpt-5.6-terra"},{"label":"State","tags":[{"text":"working","color":"blue"}]},{"label":"Folder","value":"/Users/dev/code/ledger-api"},{"label":"Started","value":"14:20"},{"label":"Last activity","value":"14:31 (10 s ago)"},{"label":"Turns","value":"0"},{"label":"Tokens","value":"55k context, 61k total"},{"label":"Process","value":"pid 48390 on ttys002"},{"label":"Session","value":"019a4f2e-6c3b-7d10-9e8f-7a6b5c4d3e21"},{"label":"Transcript","value":"~/.codex/sessions/2026/09/16/rollout-2026-09-16T14-20-00-019a4f2e-6c3b-7d10-9e8f-7a6b5c4d3e21.jsonl"}]},"claude:c47d9e10-5b6a-4c7d-8e9f-1a2b3c4d5e03":{"markdown":"## Audit the docs for broken links\n\n**You** · 14:09\n\n> Check every page of the docs for broken links and outdated screenshots, one agent per section\n\n**Claude Code**\n\nThree agents are on it: guides, reference and tutorials. I will merge what they find into one list.\n\n_cmd+t opens the transcript here_","metadata":[{"label":"Agent","value":"Claude Code 2.1.278"},{"label":"Model","value":"claude-opus-5"},{"label":"State","tags":[{"text":"3 agents","color":"blue"}]},{"label":"Folder","value":"/Users/dev/code/field-guide"},{"label":"Branch","value":"main"},{"label":"Started","value":"14:09"},{"label":"Last activity","value":"14:11 (21 min ago)"},{"label":"Turns","value":"1, the last took 140 s"},{"label":"Subagents","value":"3 running (the transcripts under ~/.claude/projects/-Users-dev-code-field-guide/c47d9e10-5b6a-4c7d-8e9f-1a